# Purge user temp dir (TMPDIR default per ~/.zshenv) after 30 days of
# inactivity. Linux only (systemd user manager; the .linux suffix keeps this
# off the darwin target). Age applies only via systemd-tmpfiles-clean.timer
# — enabled and started per-user 2026-10-17 (systemctl --user enable --now;
# verified active with the first fire scheduled). Ansible topics may promote
# to --global for the second machine.
q %h/.cache/tmp - - - 30d
